 pve-qemu-kvm (11.0.3-3) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * pbs-restore: add an optional flag to skip the host page cache when
     restoring a disk image. On ZFS, page writeback hands the restored data to
     the zvol one page at a time, which forces a read-modify-write of the
     surrounding volume block and can stall I/O of unrelated VMs for the
     duration of the restore. qemu-server uses the new flag for restores to
     zvols.
 
  -- Proxmox Support Team <support@proxmox.com>  Thu, 20 Aug 2026 23:19:02 +0200
